OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Sunken Halls
Description	Flooded galleries between two keepers, with a gem pit at the bottom of it all. Half turn symmetric. 2 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

